  "body": "**What.** The five circles of #244 (\u03bb_phys and #230's four positions) at D 61.03, M 48, kf 27. Recommended by macm3 in #244's summary (its task 2).\n\n**Why.** kf 22 duplicated kf 21, so the trend of the row with the cut rests on three distinct cuts (21, 23, 25).\n\n**Acceptance (can fail).** The \u03bb_phys circle winds +1 within 1e-5 of its kf 23 value, and each zero gets a +1 circle or a reported winding.\n\n**Depends on.** #244.\n",
